5  8.96   Copper
6  8.50   Brass
7  8.00   Stainless 304
8  4.43   Titanium Ti-6Al-4V
9  1.24   PLA
10 1.04   ABS
11 1.27   PETG
12 1.14   Nylon PA12
13 0.70   Wood, oak
